  "summary": "\n🎙️ LaWanda Lee: Gospel Artist, Fashion Designer, Systems Consultant, and Dual-Domain Strategist\nLaWanda Lee is a dynamic professional excelling in two demanding fields: as a soulful Gospel Singer/Songwriter and as a high-impact Business Systems & Automation Consultant. Hailing from the vibrant Michigan area, she applies the same principles of strategic design and seamless execution to her art and her consulting practice.\n🎶 Artistic Mastery\nA powerful vocalist and gifted songwriter from Ypsilanti/Inkster, LaWanda’s music blends classic soulful  with a modern edge.\n * Vocal Delivery: Exceptional range and control, conveying deep emotion in both heartfelt ballads and infectious, upbeat tracks.\n * Heartfelt Songwriting: Storytelling rooted in authenticity, connecting profoundly with listeners.\n * Dynamic Stage Presence: Commanding and electrifying performer, translating vision into unforgettable live execution.\n⚙️ Professional Expertise\nAs a consultant, LaWanda focuses on transforming business chaos into automated control through her core services: Business Systems & Automation Audit and Digital Infrastructure Setup. Her skills include:\n * Business Process Analysis (BPA): Dissecting complex workflows to identify inefficiencies and automation opportunities.\n * Workflow Automation & Integration: Implementing robust, scalable systems to eliminate manual tasks and ensure seamless operations.\n * Strategic Consulting: Providing actionable roadmaps that drive growth and maximize profitability.\n * Digital Implementation: Hands-on configuration and deployment of high-ticket digital infrastructure.\nLaWanda’s career demonstrates the power of structured creativity—whether engineering a three-part harmony or designing a scalable system architecture, her focus is on precision, delivery, and transformative impact.\n#RNBSinger #BusinessSystemsConsultant #WorkflowAutomation #SystemsIntegration #IndependentArtist\n",
